      "text": "Create URL Service",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "v35alPFhcCPsLZs_tTDEt",
      "originalText": "Create URL Service",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "MTyhmkc5EIU8dYm1F4mPU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1481.7760989913547,
      "y": 8755.967592557516,
      "width": 691.62646484375,
      "height": 488.8777355987996,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b67",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1610831693,
      "version": 712,
      "versionNonce": 555294893,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1747181532946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n1. generate shorten URL from origin URL\nShorten URL should be within 7 character\n2. enter shorten URL, redirect to origin URL\nOptional\n1. Track shorten URL usage\n2. Charge for service\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n1. Each shorten URL should map to a unique URL\n2. Redirect should be fast < 100 ms\n3. Support 100M URL redirect per day. 10k redirect/sec\n4. Support 1B URLs",
      "fontSize": 27.856281230700827,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n1. generate shorten URL from origin URL\nShorten URL should be within 7 character\n2. enter shorten URL, redirect to origin URL\nOptional\n1. Track shorten URL usage\n2. Charge for service\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n1. Each shorten URL should map to a unique URL\n2. Redirect should be fast < 100 ms\n3. Support 100M URL redirect per day. 10k redirect/sec\n4. Support 1B URLs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "8qIwEdaILXdtcAV1pDDdB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1496.8316986896737,
      "y": 9394.27858124932,
      "width": 210.4198455810547,
      "height": 264.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b68",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 113575309,
      "version": 217,
      "versionNonce": 996272867,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1747181071035,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entity\n- original URL\n- shorten URL\n- User\nOptional\n- Expiration time\n- alias",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entity\n- original URL\n- shorten URL\n- User\nOptional\n- Expiration time\n- alias",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "L2fN42IxfShkXZh3MzH_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2228.413442383692,
      "y": 8750.065176315335,
      "width": 731.3313598632812,
      "height": 907.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1818787139,
      "version": 819,
      "versionNonce": 1306758861,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1747181210719,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API\nPOST /urls -> shotUrl\n{\n    url,\n    alias?,\n    expiration_time?\n}\n\nGET /{shorturl} -> redirect to long URL\n\n302: temporary redirect\nPros\n- usage tracking\n- charge usage\nCons\n- heavy service usage\n\n301: permanent redirect\nRun 1st time redirect, 2nd time longUrl cached in browser\nPros\n- less service usage\nCons\n- no accurate usage tracking\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API\nPOST /urls -> shotUrl\n{\n    url,\n    alias?,\n    expiration_time?\n}\n\nGET /{shorturl} -> redirect to long URL\n\n302: temporary redirect\nPros\n- usage tracking\n- charge usage\nCons\n- heavy service usage\n\n301: permanent redirect\nRun 1st time redirect, 2nd time longUrl cached in browser\nPros\n- less service usage\nCons\n- no accurate usage tracking\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
